  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Slice zucchini into half-moons.\n• Cut beetroot into 1cm chunks.\n• TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a735d15aa7b407b754f0/step-559b3700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat.\n• Place beetroot and zucchini on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast pumpkin and veggies until tender, 25-30 minutes. Allow veggies to cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a735d15aa7b407b754f0/step-07f02410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine ciabatta chunks, savoury seasoning and a good drizzle of olive oil.\n• In the last 7 minutes of cook time, place ciabatta on the tray with the veggies. Bake until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, in a small bowl, combine fetta cubes and Greek-style yoghurt and mash to combine. Season to taste. oghurt and mash to combine. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a735d15aa7b407b754f0/step-22b5fd20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies and croutons have cooled slightly, add mixed salad leavesand balsamic vinaigrette dressing to the beetroot and zucchini tray. Toss to coat.\n• Divide veggie salad between bowls, then top with garlicky pumpkin.\n• Spoon over fetta yoghurt. Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a735d15aa7b407b754f0/step-1c847830.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
